  (label "TBD_R11_2" (at 280.67 185.42 0) (fields_autoplaced) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid ff900e1a-e774-5306-b319-67776b042309))
  (text_box "3.3 V buck\n- PU1 marking \"2622 SCT 6DC\" = SCT2622. Pin functions are from its datasheet;\n  pin numbers are assumed.\n- Values are decoded EIA-96 codes (49C = 31.6k, 86C = 73.2k, 30D = 200k).\n- Which resistors form the FB divider is not checked: measure TC1 (expect 3.3 V).\n- PC2 and R11 sit next to PU1; nets not traced.\n\nThe 1.15 V core rail (+1V15) is made by U4's internal regulator through L3\n(sheet \"Switch IC YT9215SCH\")." (at 220.98 55.88 0) (size 109.22 21.59) (stroke (width 0.1524) (type solid) (color 120 120 120 1)) (fill (type color) (color 255 255 225 1)) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 085aa450-8f70-5e2b-b0a5-f89d1f59a371))
